<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>مواقيت الصلاة</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101b3d,#31558a);color:white;text-align:center}
.container{max-width:700px;margin:auto;padding:40px 20px}
h1{font-size:38px}
.prayer{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);margin:12px 0;padding:20px;border-radius:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:20px}
.next{margin-top:25px;padding:20px;border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<h1>🕌 مواقيت الصلاة</h1>
<p>حافظ على صلاتك ❤️</p>
<div class="prayer"><span>🌙 الفجر</span><span>04:30</span></div>
<div class="prayer"><span>☀️ الظهر</span><span>12:00</span></div>
<div class="prayer"><span>🌤️ العصر</span><span>03:30</span></div>
<div class="prayer"><span>🌅 المغرب</span><span>06:30</span></div>
<div class="prayer"><span>🌙 العشاء</span><span>08:00</span></div>
<div class="next">الصلاة القادمة: <strong>المغرب</strong></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
